  "content": "# Tschipcraft 的《气泡爆裂》\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod?logo=github&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 星标\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/605235?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/total?logo=github&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 下载量\"></a>\n\n> 适用于 Minecraft 1.18.x-26.2.x 的模组\n\n## 🫧 特性\n\n这款客户端模组能让气泡粒子爆裂，并彻底改变了它们的行为，使其能够更真实地上升到水面。  \n此外，该模组还为水下打开箱子、打开木桶以及爆炸增加了气泡粒子。\n\n修复了 [MC-132067](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-132067)。\n\n## 🔧 安装方法\n\n下载最新版本，将 `.jar` 文件放入 Minecraft 目录中的 `mods` 文件夹即可。\n\n如需配置《气泡爆裂》，请同时安装适用于 Fabric 的 [MidnightLib](https://modrinth.com/mod/midnightlib) 或适用于 Forge 的 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured)。\n\n## 📺 演示视频\n\n<details>\n<summary>重制的气泡粒子行为（方块交互）</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/make_bubbles_pop/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/make_bubbles_pop/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>重制的气泡粒子行为（实体交互）</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/make_bubbles_pop/master/demo/bubble_entity_interactions.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>三叉戟轨迹</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/trident%20trail.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/trident%20trail.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>水下打开箱子</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/chest%20bubbles.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/chest%20bubbles.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>水下爆炸</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/explosion%20bubbles.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/explosion%20bubbles.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>与原版对比：灵魂沙</summary>\n<video src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437539-a666994e-2a25-4b80-aecd-240b1a979cfd.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437539-a666994e-2a25-4b80-aecd-240b1a979cfd.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>与原版对比：钓鱼</summary>\n<video src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437560-0935de11-5b12-41b2-abe8-cafc7bb86d1d.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的浏览器不支持视频标签或该视频已失效。<a href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437560-0935de11-5b12-41b2-abe8-cafc7bb86d1d.mp4\">点击此处观看视频</a></video>\n</details>\n\n## 🗺️ 计划中的特性\n\n- 原生 NeoForge 支持\n\n## 🧩 兼容性\n\n<img title=\"支持的 Minecraft 版本\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=%3C=1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n**Forge** 仅支持到 Minecraft 1.21.5。\n\n**NeoForge** 目前不提供原生支持，但您可以在 NeoForge 上运行 Fabric 版本的《气泡爆裂》，只需同时安装 [Sinytra Connector](https://modrinth.com/mod/connector) 即可。\n\n目前不建议将 [Particle Tweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-tweaks) 与《气泡爆裂》一起安装。\n\n## 🔗 外部链接\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"CurseForge 标志\" title=\"在 CurseForge 上查看《气泡爆裂》\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/badges/main/assets/curseforge-modrinth.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/make-bubbles-pop-fabric/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft 标志\" title=\"在 PlanetMinecraft 上查看《气泡爆裂》\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/en/make_bubbles_pop.html\">\n<picture>\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/assets/images/logo-black-1.svg\">\n  <img width=\"40px\" title=\"在我的网站上查看《气泡爆裂》\" src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/C0C5HEJB2\">\n<img width=\"250px\" title=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_blue.png\">\n</a>\n\n## 🤝 合作伙伴优惠\n\n想购买 **Hytale** 或升级版本？结账时使用创作者代码 `Tschipcraft`，我就能获得佣金！（您的价格不变）\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2611\">\n<img title=\"通过 Sparked Host 获取服务器并支持我（此为联盟链接）\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\">\n</a>",
